OL,3,GNEWSARising costs and fewer pupils test
OL,4,Apreschool team
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a preschool have said they
OL,7,Ffear for its future due to a declining
OL,8,Fnumber of children enrolling and rising
OL,9,Fcosts.
OL,11,FKey worker Heather Curtis said only 26
OL,12,Fchildren had been enrolled in Toad Hall
OL,13,FPreschool in Peverell, Plymouth for
OL,14,FSeptember, despite the school having a
OL,15,Fcapacity for 60.
OL,17,FTeachers said they believed the low
OL,18,Fnational birth rate was one reason for
OL,19,Fthe reduction in three and
OL,20,Ffour-year-olds who had been signed up
OL,21,Fto join the school.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
