OL,3,GNEWSARising costs and fewer pupils test
OL,4,Apreschool team
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurtis said increases to the national
OL,7,Fminimum wage, national insurance
OL,8,Fcontributions and rising costs meant
OL,9,Fthe team could not "balance the books".
